1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,200
How did you and Private Zoller
come to know one another?

2
00:00:05,633 --> 00:00:10,500
Until a few days ago, I knew nothing
about Private Zoller.

3
00:00:10,967 --> 00:00:15,333
He was a customer at my cinema.
We spoke a few times, but...

4
00:00:15,333 --> 00:00:18,333
Mademoiselle, let me interrupt you.

5
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:23,400
I forgot to order the cream.

6
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,533
Wait for the cream.

7
00:00:28,167 --> 00:00:31,867
So, Emmanuelle.
May I call you Emmanuelle?

8
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:36,767
How does a young woman like you
come to own a cinema?

9
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:42,000
The cinema originally belonged
to my aunt and uncle.

10
00:00:42,767 --> 00:00:46,533
Aunt Ada died of a fever last spring.

11
00:00:46,867 --> 00:00:49,733
There was something else
I wanted to ask you.

12
00:00:57,433 --> 00:01:01,133
But for the life of me,
I cannot remember what it was.

13
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:04,233
It must not have been important.

14
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:08,933
Until tonight.

